PolicyMethodRolesViewsTest
├── when both transfers are open
│   └── it should report both pending holders beside the current ones.
├── when both transfers are accepted
│   └── it should report the new admin and the new pause holder and no pending holders.
├── when asked about a supported interface
│   └── it should return true for IPolicyMethod, IPolicyMethodPause, IPolicyMethodAdmin and IERC165.
├── when asked about an unsupported interface
│   └── it should return false.
├── when asked for the name and the version
│   └── it should return the strings the constructor set.
├── when asked for each stored key by index
│   └── it should return the word stored at that index.
├── when asked for a key at any index below the length
│   └── it should return the word at the same position of the full list.
├── when asked for the key at the length
│   ├── it should revert.
│   └── it should name the array bounds panic.
└── when asked for a key after the keys are replaced
    └── it should return the new word at each index.
